  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.6.3 fixes two defects that made scanned pages decode to a blank raster and render as a white page with no error: indirect /Width, /Height and /BitsPerComponent on image XObjects are now resolved, and Group 3 CCITTFaxDecode streams resynchronise on fill bits and EOL codes whether or not /DecodeParms declares EndOfLine. See CHANGELOG.md.",
